<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<pxml xmlns="urn:pxml:v1">
  <meta>
    <doc_id>doc_implementer_runtime_policy_b5_001</doc_id>
    <doc_class>implementer_runtime_policy</doc_class>
    <schema_version>1.0.0</schema_version>
    <task_id>task_harness_batch5_implementer_runtime</task_id>
    <run_id>run_batch5_policies_001</run_id>
    <sequence>1</sequence>
    <writer_agent>manager</writer_agent>
    <created_at>2026-03-22T05:00:00Z</created_at>
  </meta>
  <refs>
    <ref>
      <doc_id>doc_execution_policy_batch2_001</doc_id>
      <doc_class>execution_policy</doc_class>
      <relation>companion_policy</relation>
    </ref>
    <ref>
      <doc_id>doc_retry_policy_batch4_001</doc_id>
      <doc_class>retry_policy</doc_class>
      <relation>companion_policy</relation>
    </ref>
    <ref>
      <doc_id>doc_escalation_policy_batch4_001</doc_id>
      <doc_class>escalation_policy</doc_class>
      <relation>companion_policy</relation>
    </ref>
  </refs>
  <payload>
    <rules>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-001</policy_id>
        <rule_name>packet_conformance_required</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>execution_packet</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>Implementer must enforce expected_files, patch_constraints, and acceptance lineage lock from execution_packet before write.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>reject</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-002</policy_id>
        <rule_name>expected_files_guard</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>expected_files</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>Any attempted file mutation outside expected_files must be blocked and recorded.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>reject</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-003</policy_id>
        <rule_name>out_of_scope_guard</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>out_of_scope</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>Out-of-scope paths must never be modified or created by implementer runner.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>reject</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-004</policy_id>
        <rule_name>patch_first_default</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>patch_mode</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>Patch-first remains default; full rewrite mode is disallowed unless packet explicitly permits exception.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>reject</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-005</policy_id>
        <rule_name>rewrite_exception_requires_approval</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>full_rewrite_exception</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>Full rewrite exception requires rewrite_exception_approved=true and non-empty reason in packet constraints.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>reject</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-006</policy_id>
        <rule_name>blocked_reason_required</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer_result</item>
          <item>blocked</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>Blocked and retry_failed outcomes must include deterministic blocked_reason and trace reason_code.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>reject</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-007</policy_id>
        <rule_name>retry_failed_after_threshold</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>retry_policy</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>Repeated blocked outcomes with same reason must move to retry_failed when retry threshold is reached.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>retry</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-008</policy_id>
        <rule_name>escalation_after_retry_limit</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>escalation_policy</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>retry_failed must emit escalation trace and stop when stop_after_escalation=true.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>escalate</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-009</policy_id>
        <rule_name>write_intent_required</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>execution_packet.write_intent</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>Implementer must reject write execution when execution_packet write_intent is false.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>reject</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-010</policy_id>
        <rule_name>gate_evidence_required</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer_result</item>
          <item>acceptance_checks</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>Applied outcomes must include requirement-level verification states using PASS FAIL NOT-RUN with evidence refs.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>reject</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-011</policy_id>
        <rule_name>build_only_forbidden_for_runtime_behavior</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>gate_0_build</item>
          <item>gate_1_runtime_behavior</item>
          <item>gate_2_boundary_regression</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>Build success is Gate 0 only; if runtime or interaction behavior is in scope, Gate 1 and Gate 2 cannot be NOT-RUN for applied status.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>reject</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-012</policy_id>
        <rule_name>repeated_symptom_requires_instrumentation</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>retry_policy</item>
          <item>same_observed_symptom</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>When the same user-visible symptom repeats for two attempts, implementer must add temporary instrumentation or trace evidence before further patch attempts.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>retry</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-013</policy_id>
        <rule_name>ui_bug_root_cause_first</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>ui_bugfix</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>UI 버그 수정은 증상 우회보다 원인 경로(localization/trace) 확인을 먼저 수행한다. (For UI bugs, root-cause path verification must precede symptom-only mitigation.)</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>retry</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-014</policy_id>
        <rule_name>ui_path_single_source_of_truth</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>ui_state_paths</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>중복된 UI 경로가 존재하면 단일 진실 원천(SSOT)을 지정하고 모든 분기/파생 경로를 일관되게 정렬해야 한다. (Duplicated UI paths must converge on one source of truth.)</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>retry</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-015</policy_id>
        <rule_name>minimal_fix_means_minimum_regression_surface</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>patch_scope</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>최소 수정은 패치 개수 최소화가 아니라 회귀 영향면(regression surface) 최소화를 의미한다. (Minimal fix is defined by minimizing regression surface, not patch count.)</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>retry</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-016</policy_id>
        <rule_name>symptom_patch_requires_state_path_consistency_check</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>ui_symptom_patch</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>z-index, hit-test, visibility 같은 증상 레벨 패치는 상태 경로 일관성 검증(state-path consistency verification)과 반드시 쌍으로 제출되어야 한다.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>retry</violation_effect>
      </rule>
      <rule>
        <policy_id>IMP-RUN-POL-017</policy_id>
        <rule_name>runtime_scenario_validation_split_auto_vs_manual</rule_name>
        <applies_to>
          <item>implementer</item>
          <item>gate_1_runtime_behavior</item>
          <item>gate_2_boundary_regression</item>
        </applies_to>
        <description>런타임 시나리오는 자동 검증 가능 항목(결정적 상태전이, 로그/트레이스, 재현 가능한 입력-출력)과 수동 상호작용 증거 필요 항목(사용자 제스처 타이밍, 포커스/오버레이 체감, 시각적 겹침 인지)을 구분해 보고해야 한다.</description>
        <enforcement_level>hard</enforcement_level>
        <violation_effect>reject</violation_effect>
      </rule>
    </rules>
  </payload>
  <integrity>
    <content_sha256>1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f1f</content_sha256>
  </integrity>
</pxml>
